      "message": "I can move to CONFIG_INSPECTION or CONFIG_ANALYZER.\nI don\u0027t see many lines of code under these two macros.\nDo you know is there any specific use case of them?\nI want to avoid that the new print disrupts existing functionality.\nIf no specific use case, I can move the code under CONFIG_INSPECTION.",
